# Optional. Since 0.5.0 the Bridge credentials do NOT belong in this folder:
# run scripts\set-bridge-password.ps1 once and they are stored, encrypted, in
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\JobScout, out of reach of Claude's scheduled tasks (backlog H1).
#
# Use a .env only for the path settings below. A BRIDGE_PASSWORD found here
# still works, but every run.md will warn about it.

# Which folder to read. INBOX by default. If you file job alerts into a Proton
# folder or label, name it here, e.g. Folders/Job alerts or Labels/Job alerts.
# (This can also go in %LOCALAPPDATA%\JobScout\bridge.env.)
# BRIDGE_FOLDER=INBOX

# The context vault, for the tracker (applications.md). Default:
# CONTEXT_DIR=D:\Projects\Professional development\_context   (default: "Professional development\_context" beside the Job Scout folder)

# .eml files dropped here are read as well as Bridge. Default: data\inbox
# EML_FOLDER=data\inbox

# Where the encrypted credentials live. Default: %LOCALAPPDATA%\JobScout
# JOB_SCOUT_SECURE_DIR=
